                    'en' => [
                        'soru' => 'How long is the gazebo warranty, and for how many years?',
                        'cevap' => 'The gazebo warranty runs for 5 years and starts on the delivery or installation completion date. Across that period, structural joints, roof connection points and manufacturing defects in the profiles are covered. Alternative path: parts damaged by skipped maintenance, disassembly by unauthorised people or clear customer misuse are assessed outside the standard scope, and the decision is still issued in writing. Source: the warranty text on /garanti plus the sales contract annex; the term is identical for wood, composite and aluminium with no material split on duration. On the price side the current product band is TRY 108,000–320,000 and the worked figure 16 × 12,000 × 1.00 × 1.00 × 1.00 = TRY 192,000 shows the product amount — the warranty is a service commitment on top of that amount and is not sold as a separate product. Ownership transfer is processed with a written notice. After year 5, paid maintenance and parts service continue on the same booking channels. The warranty document is handed over with the installation receipt; if it is lost, request a copy via /sss or the sales team. Practice note: the 5-year term is tracked together with the service log; the annual check note does not extend the term, it simply catches faults earlier. Next step: read the coverage details on /garanti and open a quote or appointment through /teklif-al. In rental or ownership-change scenarios the term still runs from the start date and the new owner inherits the balance. Manufacturing and joint defects stay inside cover while cosmetic fading sits with care. Unauthorised modifications can pause coverage until the inspection clears it. Extension packages are not sold today and no loyalty promise is invented without proof. Lost documents are reprinted free.',
                    ],
